  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide Sexual and Reproductive Health assistance to communities affected by Hurricane Ian in Western Cuba. This UNFPA project provides health services to vulnerable people. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 187,356 people, including 124,501 women, 14,671 men, 48,184 children, and including 17,284 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
